      "correctIndex": 0,
      "grammarFocus": "preposition ради",
      "sentenceRef": "Всё ради этого момента.",
      "explanation": "'Ради' (for the sake of) always takes genitive case: 'ради момента' (for the sake of this moment), 'ради детей' (for the children's sake), 'ради любви' (for love). It's more emotional and purposeful than 'для' (for). Compare: 'для работы' (for work — neutral) vs. 'ради мечты' (for a dream — implies sacrifice). 'Всё ради этого' = everything was for this.",
      "focusArea": "prepositions"
